.TH INITIUM 1 "version @PACKAGE_VERSION@" "@REGEN_DATE@"
.SH NAME
initium \- Multiplexer to several Initium-related utilities.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B initium
.RI "<command> <args...>"
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBlimine\fR provides a series of Initium-related utilities condensed in a single executable.
.SH BUGS
Please report bugs via
.IR @PACKAGE_BUGREPORT@ .
.SH HOMEPAGE
.I @PACKAGE_URL@
